---
---
<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-image-col">
      <div class="about-img-main placeholder-img">
        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="8" y="8" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.3"/><circle cx="24" cy="26" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.4"/><path d="M8 44 L22 30 L32 40 L40 32 L56 48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Team / Workshop Photo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-badges">
        <div class="about-badge">
          <span class="badge-num">20+</span>
          <span class="badge-label">Years in Business</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-badge">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          <span class="badge-label">Licensed & Insured</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-text">
      <span class="section-label">About Us</span>
      <h2>Craftsmanship That Speaks for Itself</h2>
      <p>Palacio Woodwork LLC was founded on one simple principle: every home deserves to be treated with the same care and precision as a fine piece of furniture. Based in South Florida, we've built our reputation on quality work, transparent communication, and lasting relationships with our clients.</p>
      <p>From the first consultation to the final walkthrough, we work closely with homeowners and contractors to bring every vision to life — on time and within budget.</p>

      <ul class="about-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5.5 9.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Licensed & Insured Contractor
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5.5 9.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Free Estimates & Consultations
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5.5 9.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Residential & Commercial Projects
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5.5 9.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          On-Time, On-Budget Delivery
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-pill btn-pill-solid">Work With Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: clamp(var(--space-10), 6vw, var(--space-20));
  align-items: center;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .about-image-col { order: -1; }
}

.about-image-col {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-5);
}

.about-img-main {
  height: 400px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
}

.about-badges {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: var(--space-4);
}

.about-badge {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  align-items: flex-start;
  color: var(--color-primary);
}

.badge-num {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--text-2xl);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--color-text);
  line-height: 1;
}

.badge-label {
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.about-text h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(var(--text-2xl), 3.5vw, var(--text-3xl));
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.08;
  color: var(--color-text);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
}

.about-text p {
  font-size: var(--text-md);
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
}

.about-list {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
}

.about-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-text);
}

.about-list svg {
  color: var(--color-primary);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
</style>
